OL,3,GNEWSACharity celebrates 40 years as 'a
OL,4,Abeacon of hope'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt took ex-punk metal drummer Alison
OL,7,FFelton 25 years to find her love of
OL,8,Fmusic again while managing her drug
OL,9,Fuse.
OL,11,FShe was supported by the Bristol Drugs
OL,12,FProject (BDP), established in 1986,
OL,13,Fwhich stuck by her through the good and
OL,14,Fbad days.
OL,16,FThe charity has since reached 40 years
OL,17,Fof service and within that time started
OL,18,Fan arts-based recovery scheme called
OL,19,FCreative Communities.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
